{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "v4/side-effect-revoke.schema.json",
  "title": "AI Tool Side-Effect & Revoke — v4",
  "description": "v4（2026-10-03，REV-16）：`revokeResult` 补上三个**实际已在发出、却未声明**的键 —— `downstreamReferences`（撤销**没够到**的那些行：类型有引用模型时才有该字段，**空数组=查过且没有**，**字段缺席=该类型没有引用模型、未检查**；判定不因此改变、也不级联）、`skipped` 与 `reason`（单条撤销的幂等跳过标记与原因，一直在发）。`additionalProperties` 仍为 true，故**旧消费者不受影响**；本次只是把已发的键补进声明面。AI 写副作用清单 item / 执行轨迹 traceItem / 单条撤销结果 / 会话级批量结果（G1）。枚举冻结：status=executed|revoked|revoking_external|revoke_failed；revokeClass=none|local_compensate|governed_external|transactional（KB-6：local_compensate≠governed_external，永不谎称 revoked）；revokeStatus=revoked|compensating|revoke_failed。**v3 变更**：级联补偿（docs/cascade-compensation.spec.md）——item/traceItem 加 `compensationGroup`（= 该次调用的幂等基键，同组=同一业务动作；null=历史单目标行）与 `parentEffectId`（根副作用的 effect id；null=根成员或单目标行）；revokeResult 加 `cascade` 汇总（组内逐条结果聚合；单目标撤销时不出现）。revokeResult/revokeBatch.results 本就是 additionalProperties:true，故加 cascade 不单独升级对象。来源：src/ai/tool-effects/ai-tool-effects.service.ts listOwned/listForConversation; src/ai/tool-effects/effect-composition.ts; src/ai/interfaces/tool.interface.ts。",
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/definitions/item"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/definitions/traceItem"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/definitions/revokeResult"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/definitions/revokeBatch"
    }
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "item": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "toolName",
        "resultType",
        "resultId",
        "createdAt",
        "targetExists",
        "targetSoftDeleted",
        "targetTitle",
        "revokeClass",
        "revokeStatus",
        "status",
        "revocable",
        "change",
        "compensationGroup",
        "parentEffectId"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "toolName": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "conversationId": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "resultType": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "resultId": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "createdAt": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "targetExists": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "targetSoftDeleted": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "targetTitle": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "revokeClass": {
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "local_compensate",
            "governed_external",
            "transactional"
          ]
        },
        "revokeStatus": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "enum": [
            "revoked",
            "compensating",
            "revoke_failed",
            null
          ]
        },
        "status": {
          "enum": [
            "executed",
            "revoked",
            "revoking_external",
            "revoke_failed"
          ]
        },
        "revocable": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "change": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/changeSummary"
        },
        "compensationGroup": {
          "description": "级联补偿组 = 该次工具调用的幂等基键；同组 = 同一业务动作的多表副作用。null = 历史/单目标副作用行",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "parentEffectId": {
          "description": "根副作用的 effect id（组内主体对象）；null = 该行即根成员，或单目标副作用行",
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "traceItem": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "toolName",
        "resultType",
        "resultId",
        "createdAt",
        "targetExists",
        "targetSoftDeleted",
        "targetTitle",
        "revokeClass",
        "revokeStatus",
        "status",
        "revocable",
        "argsHash",
        "beforeSnapshot",
        "afterSnapshot",
        "compensationGroup",
        "parentEffectId"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "toolName": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "conversationId": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "resultType": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "resultId": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "createdAt": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "targetExists": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "targetSoftDeleted": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "targetTitle": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "revokeClass": {
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "local_compensate",
            "governed_external",
            "transactional"
          ]
        },
        "revokeStatus": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "enum": [
            "revoked",
            "compensating",
            "revoke_failed",
            null
          ]
        },
        "status": {
          "enum": [
            "executed",
            "revoked",
            "revoking_external",
            "revoke_failed"
          ]
        },
        "revocable": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "argsHash": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "beforeSnapshot": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "afterSnapshot": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "compensationGroup": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "parentEffectId": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "changeSummary": {
      "description": "D2：AI 决策证据 ↔ 实际状态变化的紧凑摘要（不回显全量快照，控载荷）",
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "fields"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "created",
            "updated",
            "unknown"
          ]
        },
        "fields": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "revokeResult": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "revoked",
        "effectId"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "properties": {
        "revoked": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "effectId": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "external": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "compensated": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "message": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "revokeStatus": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "revoked",
            "compensating",
            "revoke_failed"
          ]
        },
        "compensationGroup": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "cascade": {
          "description": "级联补偿汇总（仅当该副作用属于多成员组时出现；单目标撤销不返回此键）",
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "groupId",
            "total",
            "revoked",
            "skipped",
            "failed"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "groupId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "total": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "revoked": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "skipped": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "failed": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        },
        "skipped": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "downstreamReferences": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "table",
              "remaining"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "table": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "remaining": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "revokeBatch": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "conversationId",
        "total",
        "revoked",
        "skipped",
        "failed",
        "results"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "conversationId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "total": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "revoked": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "skipped": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "failed": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "results": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "effectId",
              "revoked"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "properties": {
              "effectId": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "revoked": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "skipped": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "reason": {
                "enum": [
                  "already_revoked",
                  "compensating"
                ]
              },
              "revokeStatus": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "external": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "error": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "compensationGroup": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ]
              },
              "downstreamReferences": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "table",
                    "remaining"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "table": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "remaining": {
                      "type": "number"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}